    "aspect_exp": 0.1281,
    "note": "The generator consumes this as VOLUME plus SHAPE, not as r and L: V/V0 = (m/m0)^volume_exp with density_exp = 1 - volume_exp its exact complement, and the slenderness q = L/D left free (see aspect_trend). r = (V/(2*pi*q))^(1/3), L = 2*q*r reproduces the r(m)/L(m) fits identically at the default q."
